# Examples 1:
# Project with only source/config files - no build artifacts, dependencies, or temp files
# According to rule 6, output should be empty

# Example 2:
# Contains build artifacts like .pyc, dist/, editor configs like .vscode/, env files
# These should be added to .gitignore

*.pyc
pycache/
dist/
build/
.env
.env.local
.vscode/
.idea/
*.tmp
*.log
*.swp
node_modules/
.venv/
venv/